@@ The Menu database is a list of 1 or more Nodes.
@@ A Node is a list.
@@ Its Head is its name.
@@ Its Tail is an enumeration of the names of its subNodes or leaves.
@@ A name is a TypeName = "text" object.
@@ A subNode should occur in the database. That types it as a Node.
@@ A leaf is not a subNode. Its absence types it as a leaf.

@@ In the example above node "ConstantMenu" has a subNode "Astronomy"
